'''Unstable Magma''' is a [[Magma Cube]] type [[Mob]] that spawns when fighting {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}.

== Spawning ==
After each phase of {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}, it hides and spawns '''Unstable Magmas''' and [[Magma Glare]]s.

== Behavior ==
After being spawned by {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}, '''Unstable Magmas''' leap towards the player, dealing damage on contact. If they fall in the lava pit in the middle of the arena, they are launched away from it.

After enough of them are killed, both '''Unstable Magmas''' and [[Magma Glare]]s drift towards the center of arena and {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}} is once again spawned.

